                                "sense_id": "08ebe547-1f23-3f94-b0b9-6e4195ee3874",
                                "text": "O perplex'd diſcompoſition, O ridling diſtemper, O miſerable condition of Man."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36c5ed92-31a8-467e-bced-05fe82c77b68",
                                "sense_id": "08ebe547-1f23-3f94-b0b9-6e4195ee3874",
                                "text": "[M]y spirits began to sink under the Burden of a strong Distemper, and Nature was exhausted with the Violence of the Fever […]"
                            }
